{"4049320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ESC/APE", "steam_appid": 4049320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC/APE</strong> throws you into the role of Abe, a genetically enhanced ape bred for combat and locked away in a sterile testing facility. After a lifetime of experiments, you’re finally given a chance to prove your worth, and the chance to break free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.mp4?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum and raw power in fast-paced, physics-driven combat. Slide under hazards, ground pound enemies into the floor, and hurl objects; or your foes themselves, into walls with bone-crushing force. Every movement is a weapon, and every trial pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be just another specimen in the lab’s endless experiments, or the first to shatter its walls and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC/APE</strong> throws you into the role of Abe, a genetically enhanced ape bred for combat and locked away in a sterile testing facility. After a lifetime of experiments, you’re finally given a chance to prove your worth, and the chance to break free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.mp4?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum and raw power in fast-paced, physics-driven combat. Slide under hazards, ground pound enemies into the floor, and hurl objects; or your foes themselves, into walls with bone-crushing force. Every movement is a weapon, and every trial pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be just another specimen in the lab’s endless experiments, or the first to shatter its walls and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "ESC/APE is a first-person, physics-based combat game starring Abe, a genetically enhanced ape. Slide, ground pound, and throw your way through brutal trials to prove you’re the apex specimen and finally break free from the lab that caged you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/d3562b56fde49499f7cef1d4cfb3293da261b46a/header.jpg?t=1760642097", "capsule_